Modifications in this distribution:
  The base model was fine-tuned with LoRA for historical-document translation
  and summarization into contemporary Korean (rank 32, alpha 64, one epoch,
  9,316 optimizer steps). The adapter contains the learned modifications;
  the complete upstream backbone weights are not included.
  Training code, configuration, documentation, and an inference example
  accompany the adapter.
